    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "....\nCP Air",
      "The luxurious Boeing 747 is the world's\nlargest commercial passenger aircraft\nWing span, 195.7 ft. (59.6 meters).\nLength, 231.3 ft. (70.5 meters). Fuel ca-\nCar\npacity 42,481 imp. gals. (192,500 Itrs.)\nMax. take-off weight. 775,000 Ibs. (351,540 kgms.) Cruising\nspeed, 560 mph (900 kmh). The 747s are part of CP Air's modern\nfleet of orange jets serving five continents.\nLe luxueux Boeing 747 est le plus gros avion commercial du\nmonde. Envergure des ailes, 195.7 pi. (59.6 mètres). Longueur.\n231.3 pi. (70.5 mètres). Capacité des réservoirs: 42,481 gal. imp.\n(192,500 litres). Poids max. au décollage, 775,000 Ib. (351,540\nkgms). Vitesse de croisière, 560 m/h (900 k/h). Les 747 font par-\ntie de la flotte moderne de jets orangers de CP Air qui dessert\ncinq continents.\nOE IN CAND\nA Traveltime PRODUCT, SMITH GRANT MANN LIMITED, VANCOUVER, CANADA\nPOST\nCARD\nPOSTAGE\nSTAMP\nADDRESS\nC-2729\n2015.166.0504"
    ],
